gy. While 'male menopause' is not a universally accepted clinical diagnosis, age-related declines in testosterone (late-onset hypogonadism) are recognized, and testosterone replacement like 十一酸睾酮胶 may be prescribed to alleviate associated symptoms [Data: Relationships (19902)].\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Known adverse reaction: fluid retention\",\n            \"explanation\": \"A documented adverse reaction of 十一酸睾酮胶 is 水钠潴留 (fluid retention), which can manifest as edema or exacerbate underlying cardiovascular or renal conditions. Clinical guidelines note that if serious adverse reactions occur, treatment should be discontinued immediately and may be cautiously resumed at a lower dose once symptoms resolve. This highlights the need for monitoring during therapy [Data: Relationships (9455)].\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 4.5,\n    \"rating_explanation\": \"The impact severity rating is moderate due to the drug's essential therapeutic role in managing significant endocrine disorders, balanced by known risks such as fluid retention requiring clinical oversight.\"\n}", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null, "provider_specific_fields": {"refusal": null}}, "provider_specific_fields": {}}], "created": 1782127230, "model": "qwen3-max", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": null, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 1081, "prompt_tokens": 2939, "total_tokens": 4020, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 1280}}, "formatted_response": null, "content": "{\n    \"title\": \"十一酸睾酮胶 and Associated Medical Indications\",\n    \"summary\": \"The community centers on the drug 十一酸睾酮胶 (Testosterone Undecanoate gel), which is indicated for a range of male endocrine and reproductive disorders. These include 不育症 (infertility), 内分泌性阳痿 (endocrine-related erectile dysfunct